sequenceDiagram
    participant Screen as Screen
    participant Axios as apiClient
    participant API as API
    Screen->>Axios: request A
    Axios->>API: A with expired access token
    API-->>Axios: 401 Token has expired
    Axios->>Axios: mark A as retried, start refresh
    Axios->>API: POST /auth/refresh with the cookie
    API-->>Axios: new access token, new cookie
    Axios->>Axios: store token and context
    Axios->>API: A again with the new token
    API-->>Axios: 200 envelope
    Axios-->>Screen: data
    Note over Axios,API: If refresh fails, auth is cleared and the browser goes to /login
